gories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zBDQ3eK0jKsP64K_Xx2jgg","review_id":"F95AaJaTsv1ACwr5DYMJgg","date":"2019-05-11T03:28:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9442346096038818,"text_excerpt":"Very good Mediterranean cuisine in a part of the CBD that desperately needs restaurants. Their salads and platters are very nice. Their hummus is far superior to the other quick shawarma spots in today-complete with a few whole chickpeas and good quality olive oil. Service was not bad, had a couple of kinks but the kindness made up for it. I snuck a peak at the kitchen: VERY CLEAN!"},{"business_id":"zBDQ3eK0jKsP64K_Xx2jgg","review_id":"0QwBsB9RWURuqgM31knAkA","date":"2019-03-26T18:25:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9395444393157959,"text_excerpt":"This place just opened, and it's a nice reasonable lunch option for me coming from Poydras at City Hall. It looks like a good affordable option for a gyro/shawarma/falafel sandwich, too. ($6-8) I ordered a Greek Salad with Chicken to go. Which was quite tasty. There was a healthy amount of cucumber and feta, and just the right amount of dressing drizzled all over. The chicken was aptly spiced and not dry. I paid $12, and was overall satisfied with the quality and portion. The service was friendly and timely. Some of the wall decor is nice, but the rest of the atmosphere is lacking (fluorescent lights with tile floors). I'll be coming back to try the rest of their menu."},{"business_id":"zBDQ3eK0jKsP64K_Xx2jgg","review_id":"UePBrn0hzT0JBRjT17TAUA","date":"2019-08-19T02:06:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9350986480712891,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. The staff is always nice and friendly. Plus the and the food is great feels like a good home vibe. Also the Kunafa was phenomenal. It was a bit of a wait but it was worth it. Definitely gonna go back"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zBDQ3eK0jKsP64K_Xx2jgg","photo_id":"IGjfbHxL9s0GdgiQSIRK1g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/IGjfbHxL9s0GdgiQSIRK1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
